-## Audio Playback
-
-Use `expo-audio` not `expo-av`:
-
-```tsx
-import { useAudioPlayer } from 'expo-audio';
-
-const player = useAudioPlayer({ uri: 'https://stream.nightride.fm/rektory.mp3' });
-
-<Button title="Play" onPress={() => player.play()} />
